encoding  utf-8
survey LongwoodValleySink

input Entrance/Entrance.th
input TennisBallRift/TennisBallRift.th
input Triasic/Triasic.th
input Triasic2/Triasic2.th

equate 13@Entrance 14@TennisBallRift
equate 9@Entrance 14@Triasic
equate 19@Triasic 0@Triasic2

join EntranceSP1@Entrance TriasicSP1@Triasic
join EntranceSP2@Entrance TennisBallRiftSP1@TennisBallRift
join TriasicSP1@Triasic Triasic2SP1@Triasic2

join EntranceSE901@Entrance TriasicSE901@Triasic
join EntranceSE901@Entrance TennisBallRiftSE901@TennisBallRift
join TriasicSE901@Triasic Triasic2SE901@Triasic2

endsurvey

